# Title: Trusty Rules Content Pack (Part 1)
# Lang: [en-US]

## Section: Spelling - CVC (Doubling)
- stop + ing | stopping, stoping
  [rule: Spelling_CVC]
- run + er | runner, runer
  [rule: Spelling_CVC]
- big + er | bigger, biger
  [rule: Spelling_CVC]
- swim + ing | swimming, swiming
  [rule: Spelling_CVC]
- hot + est | hottest, hotest
  [rule: Spelling_CVC]
- plan + ed | planned, planed
  [rule: Spelling_CVC]
- sit + ing | sitting, siting
  [rule: Spelling_CVC]
- thin + er | thinner, thiner
  [rule: Spelling_CVC]
- win + er | winner, winer
  [rule: Spelling_CVC]
- skip + ed | skipped, skiped
  [rule: Spelling_CVC]

